+
+- **Respect application-builder Kernel registration.** Modern Laravel middleware navigation follows the Kernel selected by the standard application builder and preserves later explicit bindings. Dirty framework registrations refresh their source origins; unresolved effects cannot authorize partial transformations. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
